# Golden vectors for search/search_wire.situ, written by hand from its
# layout, so the description is held to a writer other than its compiler.
# 0x1A is FZN_CMD_SEARCH (26); op 1 an ask, op 2 an answer. An ask ends
# with WITHIN's length, 0 or 32 (sec 1400); ask_within names a group 9Ds.

message ask_cake      1A 01 04 63 61 6B 65 01 05 6E 6F 74 65 73 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 0A 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
message ask_after     1A 01 01 78 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 01 01 00 00 00 96 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 4D 05 6C 69 6E 65 73 02 AB CD 00 00 00
message ask_within    1A 01 01 78 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 0A 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 20 9D 9D 9D 9D 9D 9D 9D 9D 9D 9D 9D 9D 9D 9D 9D 9D 9D 9D 9D 9D 9D 9D 9D 9D 9D 9D 9D 9D 9D 9D 9D 9D
message answer_one    1A 02 00 00 01 05 6E 6F 74 65 73 01 07 00 00 00 64 00 00 00 00 00 00 03 E8 04 63 61 6B 65
message answer_none   1A 02 01 00 00
message answer_partial 1A 02 01 01 00
